From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: maslow <wangfugen@126.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 11:29:41 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Reclaim memory after durable object retirement

Collect deferred actor handles on the owning home after ordinary retirement, drain the home allocation cache, and let the durable pool manager return free allocator pages without holding a routing or isolate lock.

Team cow-a

